OL,3,GNEWSA'All anger has been taken away' -
OL,4,Asays daughter of solicitor murdered by
OL,5,AIRA, as report published
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe daughter of a solicitor murdered by
OL,8,Fthe IRA in 1977 has said a meeting
OL,9,Fwhere she and her brother learned the
OL,10,Fdetails of their father's death moved
OL,11,Fthem into a "space of serenity and
OL,12,Flight, all anger taken away".
OL,14,FIt comes as the legacy body set up to
OL,15,Finvestigate Troubles cases published
OL,16,Fits first report, examining the
OL,17,Fshooting of 59-year-old Rory O'Kelly,
OL,18,Ftargeted because he worked for the
OL,19,FDirector of Public Prosecutions (DPP).
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
