OL,3,GNEWSA'All anger has been taken away' -
OL,4,Asays daughter of solicitor murdered by
OL,5,AIRA, as report published
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe murder in Coalisland, County
OL,8,FTyrone, was examined by the Independent
OL,9,FCommission for Reconciliation and
OL,10,FInformation Recovery (ICRIR).
OL,12,FThe investigation was requested by
OL,13,FO'Kelly's now deceased son, Roger, who
OL,14,Fmet ICRIR staff last year alongside his
OL,15,Fsister and wife.
